# Every output tree, not just the live one. `outputs/` alone matched ONLY that
# name, so the rename this repo's own RUNBOOK recommends before a re-run --
# `mv outputs outputs.old.$(date +%F)` -- produced an UNIGNORED directory full of
# derived participant-level data (participants_qc.csv is per-subject motion;
# latents are keyed by sub). One `git add -A` away from being pushed.
